# Fafo Delivery Partner App — environment template
#
# Copy this file to .env.local when configuration is needed:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# No variables are required today. The app runs entirely on mock data and the
# demo OTP (`123456`); nothing in src/ reads environment values yet.
#
# Never commit .env, .env.local or any other .env.* file — only this template is
# tracked. Real values belong in your local file or in the deployment provider's
# secret store, never in the repository.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser. Anything
# sensitive (API keys, service accounts) must stay server-side and must not be
# prefixed with VITE_.

# Planned backend integration (Phase 12) — unused until Firebase is connected.
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
# VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=

# Future map provider (Phase 9/12) — unused while the route preview is a demo.
# VITE_MAP_PROVIDER_KEY=
